  "scope": "Independent Python ZIP/XML names, actual pinned Calc row/column insertions/deletions and official XSD/OPC. Relative name offsets stay recipes while bound absolute components follow cells. Calc's bang interpretation and nested Alias=Relative+10 cache of 10 after column edits are retained differences; the latter loses the calling coordinate (Relative itself is 15 after insertion and #REF! after deletion). Neither is adopted as Excel behavior. Excel web evidence covers calculation only; Excel/WPS structural runtime remains unverified.",
